    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The scenic heritage town of Ardara is widely regarded as on of Donegal most attractive towns and has been listed as one of the best places in Ireland to live. No 8 Ard na Greine is a spacious modern semi-detached house which has a total floor area of 1,525 square feet. Presented in immaculate condition throughout with a lawn area and parking space to the front plus an enclosed private garden at the rear, Ground floor accommodation comprises of a sitting room, open plan kitchen/dining room, utility room and wc with four bedrooms (one en-suite) and a main bathroom on the first floor. Situated within easy walking distance of the Main Street and all town amenities with the local National School within 200 metres. Viewing of this home is guaranteed not to disappoint."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Four bedroom semi-detached house<br><br>\nEntrance Hallway - 5.5m x 2.0m <br>Tiled floor.\ncarpeted stairs to first floor.\nWC & WHB under staircase.\n2 ceiling lights.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 5.5m x 4.6m <br>+ Box window 3.2m x 0.65m\nTwo front facing windows with blinds and curtains.\nOpen fire with timber fireplace & cast iron insert.\nFloor carpeted.\nWalls painted with feature decorative wallpaper on one wall.\n4 double electric sockets.\nTV point.\nPhone point.<br><br><br>\nDining Room - 4.5m x 4.3m <br>Pation door overlooking rear garden with curtains and vertical blinds.\nMaple wooden floor.\n3 double electric sockets.\n1 TV point.\n1 phone point.\nCentre ceiling light (chandelier not included)\nOpen archway into kitchen.<br><br><br>\nKitchen - 3.2m x 3.0m <br>High and low level kitchen units on three walls.\nStainless steel sink.\nElectric oven.\nElectric hob.\nIntegrated fridge freezer.\nFloor tiled ( continous flooring from hallway).\nWalls tiled between units.\nPVC Back door with galss panel.\nWindow overlooking rear garden.<br><br><br>\nUtility Room - 2.0m x 1.3m <br>Access from kitchen.\nHigh and low level kitchen units.\nPlumbed for washing machine & Tumble dryer (none fitted).\nGable windows.\nFloor tiled (continuous from kitchen)<br><br><br>\nLanding - 4.3m x 2.6m <br>Floor carpeted.\nGable window.\nContains hotpress.\nContains large trap door to access attic.<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.6m x 3.0m <br>+ Box window 3.2m x 0.65m\nTwo front windows (One window is tilt and turn design)\ncurtains and blinds fitted.\nLaminate timber floor.\n3 double electric sockets.\nTV point.\nPhone socket.<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 2.8m x 0.9m <br>WHB, WC & electric shower.\nFloor and walls fully tiled.\nMirror & electric light over WHB.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 4.3m x 3.2m <br>Laminate timber floor.\nWindow overlooking rear garden.\nCurtains and blinds included.\n2 double electric sockets.\nTV point.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 4.2m x 2.8m <br>Laminate timber floor.\nWindow overlooking back garden.\nCurtains & Blinds included.\n2 double electic sockets.\nTV point.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Four - 3.0m x 2.4m <br>Laminate timber floor.\nFront (Tilt and turn design) facing window.\nBuilt-in wardrobe.\n2 double elctric sockets.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 3.0m x 1.9m <br>WHB, WC & Bath.\nElectric shower.\nFloor and walls fully tiled.\nMirror & Light over WHB.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
